      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In 1352 patients with urgent diseases and traumatic injuries of the abdominal cavity organs laparoscopy was conducted. Diagnostic authenticity of method is 96.5%. Indications to remedial laparoscopy, conducted in 47.4% of patients, were rendered concrete and broadened. An acute inflammation was eliminated in 95.3% of patients, which were operated on according to the indications in a \"cool period\", 104 (7.5%) of patients died."},
